Personal site — markdown to modern HTML via Pandoc.

Structure:
  src/        Markdown source
  templates/  Pandoc HTML template (with embedded CSS)
  scripts/    Build script
  dist/       Output (gitignored)

Usage:
  bash scripts/build.sh
  cd dist && python3 -m http.server 8000

Note that currently the markdown to html styling process has not been
fully done yet, we actually manually operate the index.html manually.